{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227330/extras/4f360ef986d390006e3a0768bb3cb432.poster.avif?t=1768558968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227330/extras/4f360ef986d390006e3a0768bb3cb432.webm?t=1768558968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227330/extras/4f360ef986d390006e3a0768bb3cb432.mp4?t=1768558968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike deckbuilder, you\u2019re hunted by an Eldritch Horror. Build crushing combos, fight coordinated enemies, and reroll your abilities to survive. Infinitely upgrade weapons, forge killer synergies, and become stupidly overpowered!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227330/extras/0c8ec4a907b1a686d011acaf51d3a35a.poster.avif?t=1768558968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227330/extras/0c8ec4a907b1a686d011acaf51d3a35a.webm?t=1768558968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227330/extras/0c8ec4a907b1a686d011acaf51d3a35a.mp4?t=1768558968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy synergies:</strong> Enemies gain new abilities and interactions based on which other enemies are in the fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Enemy synergies:</strong> The player can interact with certain enemies to get beneficial effects that affect combat, e.g. killing a specific enemy causes damage to those around it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental synergies:</strong> Elemental effects can synergise e.g. Bleed damage is reduced by Cold and Disease can spread to Cold or Bleeding units.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227330/extras/9c5de69569f7ae83be448d7cc0099f70.poster.avif?t=1768558968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227330/extras/9c5de69569f7ae83be448d7cc0099f70.webm?t=1768558968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227330/extras/9c5de69569f7ae83be448d7cc0099f70.mp4?t=1768558968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Boss mechanics:</strong> It\u2019s like encountering a mini raid boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies scale as you progress:</strong> Enemies gain new abilities and become stronger depending on what level you encounter them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactives:</strong> Interact with the environment for new gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement mechanics:</strong> Your character isn\u2019t stuck in one place, which enables you to dodge certain attacks and most items have positional requirements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 